    "title": "Fact-checking Demuth's fraud claims against Klobuchar",
    "text": "Fact-checking Demuth’s fraud claims against Klobuchar\nA new TV ad from Lisa Demuth’s campaign for governor claims Sen. Amy Klobuchar has no plans to stop fraud in Minnesota, but Klobuchar’s campaign page and May 3 statements outline an extensive audit strategy. FOX 9's Corin Hoggard has more. The Demuth campaign responded after our initial story aired and said, \"When Klobuchar publishes a webpage on her website, and that's essentially the first time in years she has mentioned the topic, that may provide some important insight as to why any individual would be skeptical that Amy Klobuchar will stop the fraud.\"",
